%, transparent 70%)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold/0 group-hover:border-mlbb-gold/50 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/0 group-hover:border-mlbb-gold/50 transition-all duration-300 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-[1px] opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-300 pointer-events-none" style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #9B59B6, transparent)"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors font-heading uppercase tracking-wider" href="/heroes">Browse All Heroes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></section></div><section class="content-lazy relative border-t border-border-subtle py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="hero-faq-heading"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#faq","url":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Nana build in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nana's strongest build centers on Genius Wand, Wishing Lantern and Holy Crystal as core items, paired with the Mage Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best emblem for Nana?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The recommended emblem for Nana is Mage Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Weapon Master and Lethal Ignition talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What lane and role is Nana in Mobile Legends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nana is a Mage hero, usually played in the Mid Lane. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who counters Nana?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nana is countered most by Gloo, Atlas and Hylos, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Nana in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Nana beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Nana hard to play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nana is rated Easy difficulty in Mobile Legends. The kit is forgiving, which makes Nana a reliable pick for players still learning the role."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Nana's win rate this patch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nana currently holds a 47.5% win rate, a 2.1% pick rate, and a 4.0% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section."}}]}</script><div class="container-mlbb relative z-10"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-gold/10 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h2 id="hero-faq-heading" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-accent-bright md:text-2xl">Nana FAQ</h2></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-[80ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-[15px]">Nana is a Mage hero played in the Mid Lane.<!-- --> Its strongest build centers on Genius Wand, Wishing Lantern, Holy Crystal; open the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/build-simulator?hero=nana&amp;items=arcane-boots%2Cgenius-wand%2Cwishing-lantern%2Choly-crystal%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cblood-wings&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=mage&amp;talents=rupture%2Cweapon-master%2Clethal-ignition&amp;flex=magic-boots.arcane-boots%2Cglowing-wand.wishing-lantern%2Cwinter-crown.blood-wings">Nana build simulator</a> for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/builds/nana">Nana builds page</a>. <!-- -->See every hero that beats it on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/counter/nana">Nana counter page</a>.</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best Nana build in 2026?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Nana&#x27;s strongest build centers on Genius Wand, Wishing Lantern and Holy Crystal as core items, paired with the Mage Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best emblem for Nana?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The recommended emblem for Nana is Mage Emblem, set up with the Rupture, Weapon Master and Lethal Ignition talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_valubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What lane and role is Nana in Mobile Legends?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_valubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Nana is a Mage hero, usually played in the Mid Lane. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Who counters Nana?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Nana is countered most by Gloo, Atlas and Hylos, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Nana in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Nana beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Is Nana hard to play?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Nana is rated Easy difficulty in Mobile Legends. The kit is forgiving, which makes Nana a reliable pick for players still learning the role.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is Nana&#x27;s win rate this patch?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Nana currently holds a 47.5% win rate, a 2.1% pick rate, and a 4.0% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="content-lazy relative bg-[#000000] border-t border-[#C8AA6E]/20 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 hex-pattern opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(200,170,110,0.03), transparent)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] z-10 overflow-hidden energy-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 pt-4 pb-4"><div class="container-mlbb"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-12 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0