sition\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 2 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Dive Survival build for Nana.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana#build-mid-anti-dive-survival\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/nana\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":5,\"name\":\"Nana\",\"slug\":\"nana\",\"title\":\"Feline Wizard\",\"role\":[\"Mage\"],\"specialty\":[\"Poke\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Mid\"],\"tier\":\"C\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":50,\"offense\":60,\"controlEffect\":100,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":47.48,\"pickRate\":2.06,\"banRate\":4.05,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Nana's Passive gives her great survivability, making her strong against heroes with deadly combos, like Eudora and Kadita.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"kadita\",\"heroName\":\"Kadita\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Nana's Passive gives her great survivability, making her strong against heroes with deadly combos, like Eudora and Kadita.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"zilong\",\"heroName\":\"Zilong\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Nana can be countered by heroes with strong chasing abilities, like Zilong, Natalia, because they can chase Nana through her Passive duration.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Nana can be countered by heroes with strong chasing abilities, like Zilong, Natalia, because they can chase Nana through her Passive duration.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_4258783f9b44a4ad1c67c0b8781051fa.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ee1e0d80d87bb614a0c552ef028f85ce.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"Mages like Aurora, Due to her High damage kit, pairing her up with Nana would allow her to easily land her skills and making those 2 a pretty annoying combo to lane against.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"17\",\"heroName\":\"Fanny\",\"heroSlug\":\"fanny\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_523a730c11b8c22fc6c3fcc5575c29a2.png\",\"tip\":\"With so many Fanny roaming around, your “2” would come in handy in disabling her\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"24\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_50b8723a3ca11dd18d34d26948aef12b.png\",\"tip\":\"The Silence and her damage could shred you before you can even do anything.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Molina's Gift\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Upon taking fatal damage, Molina's Gift removes all debuffs from Nana and transforms her for 2s. While transformed, Nana is immune to all damage, gains 30% Movement Speed, and recovers 10% Max HP per second, but cannot cast skills.\\nThis effect can trigger only once every 150s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Upon taking fatal damage, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Molina's Gift\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" removes all debuffs from Nana and transforms her for 2s. While transformed, Nana is immune to all damage, gains 30% Movement Speed, and recovers 10% Max HP per second, but cannot cast skills.\\nThis effect can trigger only once every 150s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_40f1ef3190c16e8bedac960e5d600ae0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Death Immunity\"]},{\"name\":\"Magic Boomerang\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Nana hurls her Magic Boomerang in the target direction, dealing 300 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies it hits as it travels out and returns.\\n\\nThe first enemy hit takes full damage. Damage is reduced by 10% each additional enemy hit, up to a maximum total reduction of 70%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nana hurls her \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Boomerang\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, dealing 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies it hits as it travels out and returns.\\n\\nThe first enemy hit takes full damage. Damage is reduced by 10% each additional enemy hit, up to a maximum total reduction of 70%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":\"55\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_54aff0ecbd71fb7e4819568698dfbee6.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Molina Smooch\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Nana throws Molina at the target location, dealing 250 (+50% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within range and Transforming enemy heroes hit into small animals.\\n\\nIf Molina does not hit an enemy hero, she will remain on the ground and chase the nearest enemy hero that comes into range, Transforming the first enemy hero she touches.\\n\\nTransform: Reduces the target's Movement Speed by 50% and Magic Defense by 30% for 1.5s. Transformed heroes cannot attack or use skills.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nana throws Molina at the target location, dealing 250\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies within range and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Transforming\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" enemy heroes hit into small animals.\\n\\nIf Molina does not hit an enemy hero, she will remain on the ground and chase the nearest enemy hero that comes into range, \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Transforming\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" the first enemy hero she touches.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Transform\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Reduces the target's Movement Speed by 50% and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Defense\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" by 30% for 1.5s. Transformed heroes cannot attack or use skills.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":\"80\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1551014a72caf56ad15d79a118d767ed.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Debuff\"]},{\"name\":\"Molina Blitz\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Nana summons Molina to strike the target area 3 times, each dealing 440 (+140% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and slowing enemies in the area by 30% for 1s.\\n\\nConsecutive hits from Molina Blitz on the same enemy stun them for 1s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nana summons \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Molina\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to strike the target area 3 times, each dealing 440\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+140% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and slowing enemies in the area by 30% for 1s.\\n\\nConsecutive hits from \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Molina Blitz\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on the same enemy stun them for 1s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"36s\",\"manaCost\":\"135\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_32610623c520254cccf0e02a5fac9e44.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"CC\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Max “2” first, for more sustain damage.\\nFlicker a little bit more useful on Nana, as you’ll need to escape if you get caught somehow, since you don’t exactly have a running skill.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Max “2” first, for more sustain damage.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Flicker a little bit more useful on Nana, as you’ll need to escape if you get caught somehow, since you don’t exactly have a running skill.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"rafaela\",\"heroName\":\"Rafaela\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Nana works best with heroes with CC skills, that will help her get the kills, such as Rafaela and Franco.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Nana works best with heroes with CC skills, that will help her get the kills, such as Rafaela and Franco.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, Nana can use her 2nd Skill to slow the enemy first so she can hit and stun them with her Ultimate. She can then use her 1st Skill to finish off the low HP enemy.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1551014a72caf56ad15d79a118d767ed.png\"},{\"skillId\":530,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_32610623c520254cccf0e02a5fac9e44.png\"},{\"skillId\":510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_54aff0ecbd71fb7e4819568698dfbee6.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, Nana can use her 2nd Skill to harass enemy heroes and her 1st Skill to damage both enemy Minions and heroes, allowing her to poke enemies while farming.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":520,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_1551014a72caf56ad15d79a118d767ed.png\"},{\"skillId\":510,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_54aff0ecbd71fb7e4819568698dfbee6.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Nana build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Pre-placement Molina Smooch, mid and roamer laning plans, and the mistakes that lose games.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Nana is a CC battery disguised as a mage: the metric that matters is how often Molina transforms a key target, not how much damage she deals. She plays mid lane or roamer, and the two roles are not interchangeable. The difference between a Nana that wins and one that feeds is whether Molina is waiting where the enemy arrives.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"nana\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-burst-pickoff\",\"name\":\"Mid Burst Pickoff\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\",\"cost\":3000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"lethal-ignition\",\"name\":\"Lethal Ignition\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/lethal-ignition.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when lane is safe and more frequent Molina Smooch setups matter more than early flat Magic Penetration.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when healing, shields, or HP-stacking frontliners keep surviving after the first transform combo.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when one assassin can reach Nana before Molina Smooch or Flicker creates enough space.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default ranked mid build that turns Molina Smooch's Magic Defense cut into a fast pickoff window before adding late Magic Power and shield value.\",\"totalCost\":12010,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":465,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\",\"Wishing Lantern\",\"Holy Crystal\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\",\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":400,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=nana\u0026items=arcane-boots%2Cgenius-wand%2Cwishing-lantern%2Choly-crystal%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cblood-wings\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=mage\u0026talents=rupture%2Cweapon-master%2Clethal-ignition\u0026flex=magic-boots.arcane-boots%2Cglowing-wand