4244.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Nana/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Mistbender Nana\",\"tier\":\"Grand\",\"rawTier\":\"Grand\",\"tag\":\"Mistbenders\",\"tagSlug\":\"mistbenders\",\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":\"Hero100510-portrait.png\",\"portraitUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/nana/Hero100510-portrait-20240114100424.webp\",\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/nana/Nana-Mistbender-Nana-20240322094742.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Nana/Cosmetics\"},{\"name\":\"Stardust Dreamer\",\"tier\":\"Deluxe\",\"rawTier\":\"Deluxe\",\"tag\":null,\"tagSlug\":null,\"price\":\"Limited-time Event\",\"portraitFile\":null,\"portraitUrl\":null,\"splashUrl\":\"https://esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/nana/Nana-Stardust-Dreamer-20260824013607.webp\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Nana/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Nana is a sweet feline mage from the Moonlit Forest, accompanied by her mischievous companion Molina. Despite her adorable appearance, Nana possesses formidable magical abilities, including the power to transform enemies into helpless creatures. Molina, her sentient cat totem, guards Nana with a transformation trap that turns the first enemy who steps on it into a harmless version of itself. Nana's passive, Molina's Gift, even protects her from death once, making this small cat mage surprisingly difficult to eliminate.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"harith\",\"heroName\":\"Harith\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow Leonin mage and childhood friend\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"change\",\"heroName\":\"Chang'e\",\"relationship\":\"Moon companion who shares her playful nature\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"relationship\":\"Silent assassin who specializes in hunting small targets\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"relationship\":\"Blade assassin who can burst through her passive\"}]},\"lor